 "Las amapolas crecen solas junto a la alambrada: fueron las primeras flores en brotar en los campos de batalla y hoy son el símbolo del recuerdo.": "The poppies grow by themselves by the barbed wire: they were the first flowers to bloom on the battlefields and today they are the symbol of remembrance.",
