 "<div style=\"font-size:15px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#9fb3c0\">META FINAL</div><div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:34px;font-weight:700;color:#7cf29a\">EE. UU.</div>": "<div style=\"font-size:15px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#9fb3c0\">FINISH LINE</div><div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:34px;font-weight:700;color:#7cf29a\">USA</div>",
 "Cada «primera vez» era propaganda: demostraba al mundo qué sistema era mejor.": "Every “first” was propaganda: it showed the world which system was better.",
