 "Un hito por clic. El protocolo TCP/IP (1983) es el «idioma común» que permite que redes distintas hablen entre sí: por eso decimos que ahí nace internet.": "One milestone per click. The TCP/IP protocol (1983) is the “common language” that lets different networks talk to each other: that's why we say the internet was born there.",
